WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.631
ILLEGAL IMMIGRATION AND THE JOB

00:00:02.896 --> 00:00:06.900
THAT WE WON'T OR CAN'T DO.

00:00:04.765 --> 00:00:11.371
THAT'S THE FOCUS OF TONIGHT'S

00:00:07.034 --> 00:00:12.072
ANGLE.

00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:13.707
A BIG IMMIGRATION DEBATE IS

00:00:12.205 --> 00:00:16.610
UNDERWAY ON CAPITOL HILL.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.311
MITCH McCONNELL IS SAYING YOU

00:00:16.743 --> 00:00:19.813
ONLY HAVE ONE WEEK TO DO THE

00:00:17.444 --> 00:00:22.049
WHOLE THING.

00:00:19.946 --> 00:00:23.617
I'M TELLING YOU, WATCHING THIS

00:00:22.182 --> 00:00:27.421
THING, THE SAME OLD OPEN BORDERS

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:29.056
AND SUSPECTS ARE IT AGAIN.

00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:29.589
FRONT AND CENTER IS

00:00:29.189 --> 00:00:31.591
SENATOR DICK DURBIN.

00:00:29.723 --> 00:00:33.593
HE TOOK TO THE SENATE FLOOR

00:00:31.725 --> 00:00:35.062
YESTERDAY TO REPEATED THAT

00:00:33.727 --> 00:00:35.829
TEDIOUS TROPE THAT YOU AMERICANS

00:00:35.195 --> 00:00:39.066
ARE JUST TOO LAZY OR UNWILLING

00:00:35.962 --> 00:00:41.835
TO DO THE JOBS THAT ONLY ILLEGAL

00:00:39.199 --> 00:00:44.104
IMMIGRANTS WILL DO.

00:00:41.969 --> 00:00:46.139
&gt;&gt; GO TO THE LOCAL MEAT

00:00:46.273 --> 00:00:48.342
PROCESSING PLANT AND WATCH WHAT

00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:50.144
COMES OUT OF THAT PLANT AT

00:00:48.475 --> 00:00:52.913
QUITTING TIME.

00:00:50.277 --> 00:00:56.483
HISPANICS AND AFRICANS TAKING

00:00:53.046 --> 00:00:57.251
WHAT ARE PRETTY TOUGH, DIRTY,

00:00:56.617 --> 00:00:59.853
ROUGH JOBS BECAUSE OTHERS DON'T

00:00:57.384 --> 00:01:02.189
WANT THEM.

00:00:59.987 --> 00:01:04.224
NOT MANY OF US SAY TO OUR SONS

00:01:02.322 --> 00:01:05.192
AND DAUGHTERS, I'M HOPING THEY

00:01:04.358 --> 00:01:06.760
WILL, WHEN YOU DECIDED TO PICK

00:01:05.325 --> 00:01:11.265
FRUIT FOR A LIVING.

00:01:06.894 --> 00:01:12.266
YOU HARDLY EVER HEAR THAT

00:01:11.398 --> 00:01:13.033
BECAUSE WE KNOW IT'S HARD

00:01:12.399 --> 00:01:15.636
BACKBREAKING WORK AND IMMIGRANTS

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:17.204
DO THE WORK.

00:01:15.769 --> 00:01:19.139
&gt;&gt; Laura: THAT IS SO OFFENSIVE

00:01:17.338 --> 00:01:19.773
ON SO MANY LEVELS, WE CAN SPEND

00:01:19.273 --> 00:01:22.209
AN HOUR DEBUNKING IT AND

00:01:19.907 --> 00:01:24.044
ANALYZING IT.

00:01:22.343 --> 00:01:25.279
FROM MY OWN PERSONAL EXPERIENCE,

00:01:24.178 --> 00:01:27.348
MY BROTHERS, MY MOTHER AND I DID

00:01:25.412 --> 00:01:29.717
ALL OF THESE JOBS.

00:01:27.481 --> 00:01:33.854
WE DID MANUAL LABOR, FRUIT

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:34.888
PICKING, PAPER ROUTE, RESTAURANT

00:01:33.988 --> 00:01:37.625
WORK, MY MOTHER WAITED TABLES

00:01:35.022 --> 00:01:38.726
INTO HER EARLY 70s.

00:01:37.758 --> 00:01:40.061
IF SHE WERE ALIVE, I THINK ABOUT

00:01:38.859 --> 00:01:43.030
HER A LOT, I THINK SHE WOULD

00:01:40.194 --> 00:01:44.198
PROBABLY SHOW UP AT HIS OFFICE

00:01:43.164 --> 00:01:44.966
TO THROW ONE OF HER OWN

00:01:44.332 --> 00:01:46.634
POLYESTER UNIFORMS AT HIM, SHE

00:01:45.099 --> 00:01:47.802
WOULD BE SO MAD.

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:50.838
I'LL TELL YOU WHAT'S REALLY

00:01:47.935 --> 00:01:52.239
GOING ON IN THIS WHOLE DEBATE.

00:01:50.972 --> 00:01:54.308
THE DEMOCRATS DON'T REALLY CARE

00:01:52.373 --> 00:01:55.710
ALL THAT MUCH ABOUT THESE

00:01:54.442 --> 00:01:58.245
ILLEGAL WORKERS, AS MUCH AS THEY

00:01:55.843 --> 00:01:58.846
CARE ABOUT GETTING THEIR POWER

00:01:58.379 --> 00:02:00.414
BACK.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:01.616
WHAT DO I MEAN?

00:02:00.548 --> 00:02:03.351
WE KNOW A LOT OF MIDDLE-CLASS

00:02:01.749 --> 00:02:05.419
VOTERS ARE FED UP WITH THE

00:02:03.484 --> 00:02:06.754
DEMOCRATS.

00:02:05.553 --> 00:02:09.223
THE PARTY HAS TO BEGIN TO REMAKE

00:02:06.888 --> 00:02:10.691
THE ELECTORATE.

00:02:09.357 --> 00:02:12.293
HIS STATEMENT IGNORES THE FACT

00:02:10.825 --> 00:02:15.830
THAT THE INFLOW OF ALL THE CHEAP

00:02:12.426 --> 00:02:17.632
IMMIGRANT LABOR HURTS AMERICANS.

00:02:15.963 --> 00:02:19.667
WHO ACTUALLY WILL DO THOSE JOBS

00:02:17.765 --> 00:02:20.902
THAT HE TURNS HIS NOSE UP AT.

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:24.639
HERE'S HOW MY RADIO COLORS

00:02:21.035 --> 00:02:26.107
REACTED TO HIS COMMENTS TODAY.

00:02:24.772 --> 00:02:28.676
&gt;&gt; I WAS IN A POSITION WHERE I

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:31.079
DESPERATELY NEEDED A JOB.

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:34.916
I WENT AROUND TO THESE LOCATIONS

00:02:31.212 --> 00:02:35.717
THAT SAID WERE ONLY HISPANICS IN

00:02:35.049 --> 00:02:37.752
THE RESTAURANTS, I COULDN'T GET

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:41.222
MY FOOT IN THE DOOR.

00:02:37.885 --> 00:02:42.523
&gt;&gt; I HAVE 38 YEARS EXPERIENCE

00:02:41.356 --> 00:02:43.491
FOR HEAVY DEMOLITION, I GOT

00:02:42.657 --> 00:02:47.195
TURNED DOWN FOR THREE JOBS

00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:49.263
BECAUSE I DON'T SPEAK SPANISH.

00:02:47.328 --> 00:02:51.733
&gt;&gt; Laura: FOR A FAIR WAGE,

00:02:49.397 --> 00:02:52.834
AMERICANS WILL DO AND HAVE DONE

00:02:51.866 --> 00:02:56.838
THESE JOBS, SENATOR DURBIN --

00:02:52.967 --> 00:02:57.906
STOP LYING TO US.

00:02:56.971 --> 00:02:58.840
PRESERVING ENTRY-LEVEL WORK

00:02:58.039 --> 00:03:00.742
OPPORTUNITIES FOR AMERICANS IS

00:02:58.973 --> 00:03:01.843
IMPORTANT FOR YOUNG PEOPLE, IT'S

00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:03.011
ALSO REALLY IMPORTANT FOR THOSE

00:03:01.976 --> 00:03:03.912
WHO DON'T HAVE A COLLEGE DEGREE,

00:03:03.144 --> 00:03:08.283
MAY BE FOR THOSE WHO DON'T HAVE

00:03:04.045 --> 00:03:09.017
A SPECIAL SKILL SET.

00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:12.020
I THINK IT'S REALLY INTERESTING

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:12.754
TO LOOK BACK, TO SEE HOW THE

00:03:12.153 --> 00:03:15.223
DEMOCRATS HAVE SHIFTED ON THE

00:03:12.887 --> 00:03:16.825
IMMIGRATION ISSUE.

00:03:15.357 --> 00:03:17.592
I REMEMBER THE TIME WHEN

00:03:16.958 --> 00:03:21.062
DEMOCRATS ACTUALLY SUPPORTED THE

00:03:17.726 --> 00:03:22.230
WORKING MEN AND WOMEN OF THE

00:03:21.196 --> 00:03:22.931
COUNTRY, THEY WORRIED ABOUT

00:03:22.364 --> 00:03:25.834
FLOODING THE NATION WITH POOR

00:03:23.064 --> 00:03:27.402
PEOPLE FROM OTHER COUNTRIES WHO

00:03:25.967 --> 00:03:28.637
ARE GOING TO COMPETE WITH POOR

00:03:27.535 --> 00:03:29.337
PEOPLE ALREADY IN OUR COUNTRY

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.273
WHO ARE AMERICAN CITIZENS OR

00:03:29.471 --> 00:03:35.310
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS.

00:03:31.406 --> 00:03:37.980
25 YEARS AGO, THIS WAS DIANNE

00:03:35.443 --> 00:03:38.814
FEINSTEIN.

00:03:38.113 --> 00:03:40.015
&gt;&gt; MEXICO DOES NOTHING TO

00:03:38.947 --> 00:03:44.286
ENFORCE ITS BORDERS.

00:03:40.149 --> 00:03:47.890
IT IS MY VIEW THAT IF WE ARE

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:48.590
GOING TO HAVE A NORTH AMERICAN

00:03:48.023 --> 00:03:53.228
FREE TRADE AGREEMENT, MEXICO

00:03:48.724 --> 00:03:55.297
MUST DO ITS SHARE.

00:03:53.362 --> 00:04:00.602
TODAY AMERICA COULD BE THE

00:03:55.431 --> 00:04:02.204
WELFARE SYSTEM.

00:04:00.736 --> 00:04:03.305
THE PEOPLE WHO SHOULD BE HERE

00:04:02.337 --> 00:04:05.174
HAVE COME LEGALLY AT THIS TIME.

00:04:03.439 --> 00:04:11.447
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHAT HAPPENED TO

00:04:05.307 --> 00:04:09.878
THAT DIANE'S         DIANNE FEIS

00:04:09.878 --> 00:04:09.912
THAT DIANE'S         DIANNE FEIE

00:04:09.912 --> 00:04:10.345
THAT DIANE'S         DIANNE FEIN

00:04:10.345 --> 00:04:12.147
THAT DIANE'S         DIANNE FEI.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.650
IMAGINE IF A REPUBLICAN MADE

00:04:12.281 --> 00:04:16.418
THAT COMMENT TODAY.

00:04:14.783 --> 00:04:17.219
THERE WOULD BE HOWELLS FOR THE

00:04:16.552 --> 00:04:23.592
LAME STREAM MEDIA AND DEMOCRATS,

00:04:17.352 --> 00:04:24.626
HOW CAN YOU SAY THAT?

00:04:23.725 --> 00:04:26.762
THIS IS BERNIE SANDERS 11 YEARS

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:30.899
AGO WHO SPOKE OUT AND VOTED

00:04:26.895 --> 00:04:32.835
AGAINST GEORGE W. BUSH'S PUSH

00:04:31.033 --> 00:04:35.637
FOR AMNESTY.

00:04:32.968 --> 00:04:37.506
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S HIGH TIME THAT

00:04:35.771 --> 00:04:39.975
THE SENATE OF THE UNITED STATES

00:04:37.639 --> 00:04:42.644
OF AMERICA BEGAN TO STAND FOR

00:04:40.108 --> 00:04:44.680
THE AMERICAN WORKER AND I WOULD

00:04:42.778 --> 00:04:47.049
HOPE BEFORE AN IMMIGRATION BILL

00:04:44.813 --> 00:04:50.185
IS PASSED THAT IT WOULD RESPECT

00:04:47.182 --> 00:04:54.456
THE WHITES OF AMERICAN WORKERS

00:04:50.319 --> 00:04:56.625
AND PROFESSIONAL WORKERS.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:57.292
&gt;&gt; Laura: SANDERS IS RIGHT,

00:04:56.758 --> 00:05:00.062
WHERE IS THE CONGRESSIONAL

00:04:57.426 --> 00:05:01.897
CONCERN FOR THE HUMAN DIGNITY OF

00:05:00.195 --> 00:05:03.465
AMERICA'S LOW SKILLED WORKERS

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:07.636
TODAY.

00:05:03.599 --> 00:05:08.937
THEY CALL THEM THE WORKING POOR,

00:05:07.769 --> 00:05:09.338
PEOPLE CAN SUPPORT FAMILIES ON

00:05:09.071 --> 00:05:13.609
THESE JOBS.

00:05:09.471 --> 00:05:15.244
THEY CAN LIVE DECENT LIVES.

00:05:13.742 --> 00:05:16.011
IN CERTAIN LIMITED

00:05:15.377 --> 00:05:16.712
CIRCUMSTANCES, IN PARTICULAR

00:05:16.145 --> 00:05:18.247
INDUSTRIES, GUEST WORKERS DO

00:05:16.845 --> 00:05:19.047
MAKE SENSE.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.217
IT SHOULDN'T BECOME THE NORM, IT

00:05:19.181 --> 00:05:24.319
DOESN'T HAVE TO BE.

00:05:22.351 --> 00:05:25.220
I WAS THINKING ABOUT THIS AS

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:27.523
WELL.

00:05:25.354 --> 00:05:30.426
IT'S JUST ONCE IN A BLUE MOON WE

00:05:27.656 --> 00:05:32.494
HEARD SOMEBODY LIKE A SENATOR

00:05:30.559 --> 00:05:36.432
SENATOR DURBIN SPEAK IN SUCH

00:05:32.628 --> 00:05:37.800
EMOTIONAL TERMS ABOUT INNOCENT

00:05:36.565 --> 00:05:38.834
AMERICANS WHO LOST THEIR JOBS OR

00:05:37.933 --> 00:05:40.269
THEIR LIVES AT THE HANDS OF

00:05:38.968 --> 00:05:44.306
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANTS.

00:05:40.402 --> 00:05:47.676
CASE IN POINT -- ON SUNDAY, AND

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:49.712
ILLEGAL IMMIGRANT SLAMMED INTO

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:54.884
AN AMBULANCE CARRYING A MOTHER

00:05:49.845 --> 00:05:56.218
AND HER 3-YEAR-OLD BOY IN

00:05:55.017 --> 00:05:56.952
WINSTON-SALEM.

00:05:56.352 --> 00:05:59.221
ALCOHOL BLOOD LEVEL WAS DOUBLE

00:05:57.086 --> 00:06:01.457
THE LEGAL LIMIT.

00:05:59.355 --> 00:06:04.694
HE INJURED THE MOTHER AND THE

00:06:01.591 --> 00:06:07.263
DRIVER AND THE LITTLE BOY IS

00:06:04.827 --> 00:06:11.801
DEAD.

00:06:07.396 --> 00:06:13.169
HOW MANY INNOCENT LIVES HAVE TO

00:06:11.934 --> 00:06:14.470
BE LOST BEFORE THE U.S. CONGRESS

00:06:13.302 --> 00:06:16.505
FOCUSES ON THE WELL-BEING OF

00:06:14.604 --> 00:06:19.108
AMERICAN CITIZENS AND LEGAL

00:06:16.639 --> 00:06:21.177
IMMIGRANTS RATHER THAN KOWTOWING

00:06:19.242 --> 00:06:30.219
TO THE BUSINESS LOBBY?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:31.421
WE ARE ALL WAITING.

00:06:30.353 --> 00:06:32.722
DICK DURBIN HAS A JOB THAT CAN'T

00:06:31.554 --> 00:06:33.456
BE TAKEN BY AN ILLEGAL IMMIGRANT

00:06:32.855 --> 00:06:43.466
MAYBE HE NEEDS A TASTE OF HIS

00:06:33.589 --> 00:06:44.901
OWN MEDICINE THERE.

00:06:43.599 --> 00:06:47.837
IF IT ENDS UP BEING A DEAL AT

00:06:45.034 --> 00:06:48.738
ALL, THE NEEDS OF THE AMERICAN

